# Target: CPython 3.12, Ubuntu 24.04 x86_64 / WSL2.
# The upstream InsightFace dependency 'onnxruntime' is intentionally satisfied
# by the onnxruntime module in onnxruntime-gpu. NEVER install both distributions.
# Resolve with --no-emit-package onnxruntime, install with --no-deps --require-hashes,
# then run environment.py. That validator checks all dependency edges and permits
# only this explicit module-provider substitution.
